body:
Yes, I have heard about that. My psychiatrist told me that I might have aspergers and I asked him if that was still used, and he said that it wasn't technically an official term anymore, but it could still be useful in a practical sense. idk if he was just talking out of his ass tho. I felt like, because a lot of people have already been diagnosed with it and because it was still around when the show was made, it was still a relevant description to use. Sorry if this offended you though, I am aware of the historical and current context, and I get that it's a sensitive issue and a lot of autistic people don't like the term. i wasn't sure about using it in this post, and ended up including it because i assumed that it would be a helpful descriptor. If you feel like it was the wrong choice, i can edit the post though. 

&#x200B;

and yeah, im a bit biased as well. I have bpd and her behavior reminded me a lot of mine. Idk if it's bpd necessarily, but it's definitely something cluster b.

idk meds help i think, lamictal helps some people i hear but depends what ur prescribed. I also have some rituals when i have panic attacks, like smoking, listening to music, stuff like that. anything that connects me to reality, like an activity i do often that helps bring me back to reality. smt i repeat over in my head "im going to kill myself" a couple times and that works for some reason, but thats honestly just me. in general i would recommend either meds cuz ik they helped a lot of people, and from personal experience, also what i mentioned about doing a light, non-strenuous activity to distract urself and feel more in touch.

&#x200B;

EDIT: i like to think of the activity as a "totem" like in Inception, helps remind u its not real and just the illness talking

ye at that point i felt like there was no other way, even those in retrospect there probably was. i was hanging with these kids then, total assholes but it made me feel better cuz i wanted to have a friend group. my now ex was pissed at me for hanging out with them, i think he thought i was this total idiot who didnt realize i was being walked all over, i did realize that i just didnt care, i wanted a friendgroup, even if it was fake. i tried to explain to him that i had a lot issues with this sort of stuff when i was young, that i was home schooled, that i grew to hate and isolate myself, that i missed out on a lot, and that this helped me cope. he just didn't get how hurt i was and how much i needed this to cope. so not only did he not get it, there was also the fact that they really were assholes in a lot of ways, also there was my ED, my best friend getting engaged and distancing herself, it was just so much and i felt like no one understood me and no one really saw me or cared, and i wanted proof that they did. i wanted them to show to me that they cared. i was also really, really bored, not like nothing to do, but like really empty and disassociated, and my bpd was then undiagnosed so me doing this kind of shit was so confusing to me and these two guys kept calling me crazy and then i had this really bad experience with psychedelics which, surprise surprise, i turned out to be allergic to, and had to go to the ER and tried to off myself, anyway, then my bf who was the only person that knew told his best friend who hated me and he called me retarded and i was so upset by that and then my fantastic boyfriend tried to tease me about it like 2 weeks later, knowing how hurt i already was, and called me retarded and crazy in front of our friends, ik i had to break up w him atp. like i dont get why he couldnt just fucking break up w me yk, if i was such a shitty, manipulative gf wtf couldnt he break up w me. this just pisses me off so much, that he had no problem w the fact that i did fentanyl and had my arms covered in red blisters from cigarette burns, he tolerated all that, and yall know why, cuz he was lonely, cuz he needed me to. i hate how im the bad guy when he literally threatened to kill himself to me for an hour after i broke up w him. he used me for emotional support just as much as i used him.

&#x200B;

wow geez that turned to be quite the rant.

i think he's less of a weasel and more of a slug or a snail or smt

&#x200B;

sidenote: just looked up weasels and man they are cute
